"_89":95,"_91":96},{"_82":83,"_19":84,"_85":86,"_87":88,"_89":90,"_91":92},"id","arena-webdev","Arena WebDev","operatorId","lmarena","dimension","human","url","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/arena-webdev","summary","真人匿名比较两个模型生成的网页作品。","arena-text","Arena Text","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/arena-text","真人匿名比较两个模型的文本回答。","bullshitbench","BullshitBench v2","qa","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/bullshitbench-v2","识别问题中的错误前提，而不是顺着错误编造。","nyt-connections","NYT Connections 扩展版","lech-mazur","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/nyt-connections","将带干扰项的英文词语按隐藏类别分组。","livebench-language","LiveBench 语言与指令","livebench","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/livebench-writing","语言理解和按复杂要求作答的动态题集。","aa-mlcr","MLCR-AA","artificial-analysis","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-mlcr","根据长医疗记录完整且忠实地回答问题。","aa-lcr","AA-LCR","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-lcr","阅读长文档并串联多处信息回答问题。","opencompass-knowledge","司南知识","opencompass","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/opencompass-knowledge","应用科学、生活、自然和人文社科知识题。","epoch-simpleqa","SimpleQA Verified","epoch","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/epoch-simpleqa","一句话可回答的可核验事实问题。","aa-omniscience","AA-Omniscience v1.1","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-omniscience","跨领域事实问答，答错倒扣且允许不答。","vals-excel","Excel Modeling v1.1","vals","office","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-excel","在 Excel 中补全或从零搭建财务模型。","vals-tax","TaxAgentBench","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-tax","回答税务问题并给出税法依据。","vals-legal","Legal Research Bench","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-legal","检索法规判例并写出有出处的法律结论。","aa-analyst","AA-Analyst Agent","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-analyst-agent","跨 14 个专业领域完成数据分析问题。","vals-medcode","MedCode","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-medcode","读取住院记录并生成标准医疗诊断编码。","livebench-data","LiveBench 数据分析","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/livebench-data-analysis","表格重排、连接和连续事件分析任务。","mercor-banking","τ³-Banking（Mercor）","mercor","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/mercor-tau3-banking","使用政策和工具办理模拟银行客服业务。","aa-harvey","Harvey LAB 1.1（AA）","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-harvey-lab","独立复跑法律文书任务并检查重大捏造。","vals-harvey","Harvey LAB 1.1（Vals）","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-harvey-lab","处理法律资料并交付文档、表格和幻灯片。","mercor-apex-agents","APEX-Agents 1.1","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/mercor-apex-agents","投行、咨询和法律场景中的完整长任务。","vals-finance","Vals Finance Agent v2.1","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-finance-agent","查阅财报并完成金融计算和分析。","aa-automation","AutomationBench（AA）","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-automationbench","在模拟办公软件中完成业务流程。","aa-briefcase","AA-Briefcase","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-briefcase","完成办公项目中的报告和表格长任务。","aa-gdpval","GDPval-AA","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-gdpval","几十种职业的报告、表格等真实交付任务。","vals-biomystery","BioMysteryBench","research","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-biomystery","分析真实生物数据并推断生物学答案。","aa-terminal-science","Terminal-Bench Science（AA）","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-terminal-bench-science","Artificial Analysis 独立复跑科研终端流程。","vals-terminal-science","Terminal-Bench Science（Vals）","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-terminal-bench-science","在终端中完成数据处理和科研分析流程。","vals-mystery","MysteryMechanism","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-mysterymechanism","自行设计实验并推断隐藏规律。","epoch-mystery","Mystery Game Puzzles","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/epoch-mystery","根据文字游戏局面推断最佳下一步。","epoch-chess","Chess Puzzles","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/epoch-chess","读取文字棋局并找出由引擎核验的最佳一步。","aa-critpt-hard","CritPt v2 Hard（AA）","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-critpt-v2-hard","可使用代码辅助演算的高难研究物理题。","aa-critpt","CritPt（AA）","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-critpt","物理研究前沿的原创推导题。","opencompass-abstraction","司南抽象","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/opencompass-abstraction","注意扫描、语言理解和抽象概念识别。","arc-agi-2","ARC-AGI-2","arc-prize","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/arc-agi-2","从少量网格示例中归纳未知变换规则。","opencompass-reasoning","司南推理","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/opencompass-reasoning","逻辑、数量、空间、物理和批判性思维。","llm2014-reasoning","致知逻辑月榜","llm2014","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/llm2014-reasoning","中文逻辑、数学、空间和编程难题。","livebench-reasoning","LiveBench 推理与数学","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/livebench-reasoning","持续更新的逻辑、空间推理和数学任务。","epoch-frontiermath","FrontierMath T1–3","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/epoch-frontiermath","数学家原创的高难数学题。","aa-hle","Humanity's Last Exam（AA）","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-hle","数学、科学和人文等多学科专家级难题。","taptap-maker","TapTap Maker","taptap","coding","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/taptap-maker","在真实游戏引擎中实现并运行 Lua 游戏功能。","frontierswe","FrontierSWE v2","proximal","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/frontierswe-v2","最多持续 20 小时完成复杂工程和科研计算任务。","weirdml","WeirdML v3","havard","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/weirdml","面对陌生数据完成机器学习或数据分析方案。","cognition-frontiercode","FrontierCode 2.0（Cognition）","cognition","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/frontiercode","Cognition 在真实开源仓库中运行 FrontierCode。","mercor-apex-swe","APEX-SWE","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/mercor-apex-swe","连接部署服务，并依据日志和监控排查系统故障。","aa-frontiercode","FrontierCode 2.0（AA）","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-frontiercode-2","在真实开源仓库中完成维护者级代码改动。","vals-cyber-patch","CyberBench Patch v1.1","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-cyber-patch","修复真实安全漏洞并保持正常行为。","vals-vibe-code","Vibe Code Bench v1.1","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-vibe-code","从零实现网页应用并按浏览器验收步骤检查。","epoch-mirrorcode","MirrorCode","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/epoch-mirrorcode","看不到源码，通过运行和文档重建整个程序。","vals-program","ProgramBench","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-program","只看行为和文档，重写出等价程序。","vals-migration","Code Migration v1.1","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-migration","把现有程序迁移到另一种语言并通过隐藏测试。","aa-scicode","SciCode（AA）","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-scicode","将物理、化学和生物问题写成可运行计算代码。","livebench-coding","LiveBench 编程综合","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/livebench-coding","写函数、补代码并在真实仓库中修复问题。","official-terminal-bench","Terminal-Bench 4.0（官方）","terminal-bench","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/terminal-bench-4","官方榜为不同模型指定代表 Agent 完成终端任务。","vals-terminal-bench","Terminal-Bench 4.0（Vals）","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/vals-terminal-bench-4","Vals AI 独立复跑 Terminal-Bench 4.0。","aa-terminal-bench","Terminal-Bench 4.0（AA）","https://aihot.news/leaderboard/sources/artificial-analysis-terminal-bench","Artificial Analysis 独立复跑终端软件与科研任务。",{"_82":114,"_19":386,"_344":386,"_89":387,"_346":388},{"_82":137,"_19":383,"_344":383,"_89":384,"_346":385},{"_82":316,"_19":380,"_344":380,"_89":381,"_346":382},{"_82":109,"_19":377,"_344":377,"_89":378,"_346":379},{"_82":128,"_19":374,"_344":374,"_89":375,"_346":376},{"_82":163,"_19":371,"_344":371,"_89":372,"_346":373},{"_82":275,"_19":368,"_344":368,"_89":369,"_346":370},{"_82":270,"_19":365,"_344":365,"_89":366,"_346":367},{"_82":265,"_19":362,"_344":362,"_89":363,"_346":364},{"_82":259,"_19":258,"_344":258,"_89":360,"_346":361},{"_82":242,"_19":242,"_344":242,"_89":243,"_346":359},{"_82":123,"_19":356,"_344":356,"_89":357,"_346":358},{"_82":233,"_19":353,"_344":353,"_89":354,"_346":355},{"_82":86,"_19":350,"_344":350,"_89":351,"_346":352},{"_82":104,"_19":348,"_344":348,"_89":105,"_346":349},{"_82":97,"_19":343,"_344":345,"_89":100,"_346":347},"Peter Gostev / BullshitBench","shortName","BullshitBench","description","用包含错误前提的问题检验模型是否会识别并纠正谬误。","Lech Mazur","维护 NYT Connections 扩展词语归类评测。","LMArena","https://lmarena.ai/","通过匿名两两对战收集真人对文本回答和网页作品的偏好。","ARC Prize","https://arcprize.org/","维护以陌生网格规则归纳为核心的 ARC-AGI 评测。","Ope